			29 00 00 03 cb 00 01
			29 00 00 03 d0 00 91
			29 00 00 03 d1 00 68
			29 00 00 03 d2 00 68
			29 00 00 05 f5 00 00 00 a5
			29 00 00 03 f1 00 10
			29 00 00 03 f0 00 00
			29 00 00 03 f0 00 02
			29 05 00 1d e0 00 70 00 09 00 12 00 0c 00 0b 00 27 00 38 00 54 00 4e 00 19 00 15 00 15 00 2c 00 2f
			29 05 00 1d e1 00 70 00 08 00 11 00 0c 00 0b 00 27 00 38 00 43 00 4c 00 18 00 14 00 14 00 2b 00 2d
			29 00 00 03 f0 00 10
			29 00 00 03 f3 00 10
			29 00 00 03 e0 00 08
			29 00 00 03 e1 00 00
			29 00 00 03 e2 00 0b
			29 00 00 03 e3 00 00
			29 00 00 03 e4 00 e0
			29 00 00 03 e5 00 06
			29 00 00 03 e6 00 21
			29 00 00 03 e7 00 00
			29 00 00 03 e8 00 05
			29 00 00 03 e9 00 82
			29 00 00 03 ea 00 df
			29 00 00 03 eb 00 89
